<title>USA: Comforce Corp Q3 results.</title>
<headline>Comforce Corp Q3 results.</headline>
<dateline>LAKE SUCCESS, N.Y. 1996-11-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>(In thousands, except per share data)</p>
<p>				 Three mos ended	 Nine mos ended</p>
<p>				    Sep 30, 1996	   Sep 30, 1996</p>
<p> Revenues				$20,356		  $33,514</p>
<p> Income from continuing operations   455			907</p>
<p>Income per share from</p>
<p>  continuing operations		 0.03		     0.06</p>
<p>Weighted average shares and</p>
<p>  equivalent shares outstanding   13,303		   13,103</p>
<p>NOTE - Comforce said prior year's figures are not include because it was engaged in businesses that have subsequently been discontinued, making a comparison of results not meaningful.</p>
<p>-- New York Newsdesk 212 859-1610</p>
